ne><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4680244/forthesovereign\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">For the Sovereign</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_5385263\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_7161653\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"720\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 720px\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" data-width=\"1280\"><button class=\"fullscreen_btn\" title=\"Enter fullscreen\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18724532/index.html?v=1786202277&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a data-donate=\"false\" class=\"button donate_btn\" href=\"https://iterlith-games.itch.io/forthesovereign/purchase\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>For the Sovereign is a single-player fantasy kingdom simulator built around indirect control. Construct a settlement, recruit heroes, research upgrades, and place bounties to encourage your subjects.</p>\r\n<p>Join the Discord!&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/b5sPWvq2Eq\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://discord.gg/k8Meu9rKnD</a></p>\r\n<p>Leave a rating and let me know what you think!&nbsp;<a href=\"https://guildstead-games.itch.io/forthesovereign/rate\" style=\"font-size: inherit\">https://guildstead-games.itch.io/forthesovereign/rate</a></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Features</h2>\r\n<ul class=\"text-justify\"><li class=\"text-justify\">&nbsp;Guide autonomous heroes with attack, defense, and exploration bounties</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Recruit 22 different hero classes, each with their own unique role and personality</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Develop your kingdom with diverse building, upgrades and an extensive research tree</li><li class=\"text-justify\">&nbsp;Watch heroes level up, learn abilities, collect loot, and buy equipment from your shops</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Manage a physical economy where Tax Collectors must carry revenue back to your treasury</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Fight epic monsters, escalating raids, and rival AI kingdoms</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Play an 8-mission tutorial campaign, standalone challenges, or procedural custom games</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Configure custom maps with different threats, lair densities, seeds, and up to eight allied or hostile AI kingdoms</li><li class=\"text-justify\">Create and playtest missions with the included map editor</li></ul>\r\n<p><strong>Note: For the Sovereign is in early development.</strong><em> Content, balance, and features are actively being added and changed. Expect rough edges. Feedback is always appreciated!</em></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>The web version will have noticeably slower load times and moderately worse performance. For the best experience downloading the exe is recommended.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Windows Defender will most likely block the exe from launching. Just do Show More -&gt; Run Anyway&nbsp;\r\n</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_5971843\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"08 August 2026 @ 15:17 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 25 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-develop